<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40680" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rĕ-curvo</span></b> , no <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>perf.</i>, ātum,
			1, v. a., <i>to bend</i> or <i>curve backwards</i>, <i>to turn
			back</i> (not ante-Aug.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">equi colla,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. H.
					4, 79</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">radicem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					5, 10, 13</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palmam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell.
					3, 6, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in caput aquas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Am. 1, 8, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gladios in vulnera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 3, 583</span></i>
			. — In <i>part. perf.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mucrone intus recurvato,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					7, 7, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">os magis in exteriora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 8, 1
						<i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undae (Maeandri),</span>”
				<i>winding</i>, <i>serpentine</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					2, 246</span></i>
			.</div>
